# Hub — Testing Patterns

## Go Backend Tests

### Integration Tests (preferred)

```go
// Use real databases via testcontainers
func setupTestDB(t *testing.T) *ent.Client {
    t.Helper()
    ctx := context.Background()
    
    pg, err := postgres.RunContainer(ctx,
        testcontainers.WithImage("postgres:17-alpine"),
        postgres.WithDatabase("hub_test"),
        postgres.WithUsername("hub"),
        postgres.WithPassword("test"),
        testcontainers.WithWaitStrategy(wait.ForListeningPort("5432/tcp")),
    )
    require.NoError(t, err)
    t.Cleanup(func() { pg.Terminate(ctx) })
    
    dsn, _ := pg.ConnectionString(ctx, "sslmode=disable")
    client, err := ent.Open("postgres", dsn)
    require.NoError(t, err)
    require.NoError(t, client.Schema.Create(ctx))
    return client
}
```

### Unit Tests with Mocks

```go
// Use mockery: go generate ./... in package with //go:generate
//go:generate mockery --name Repository --outpkg mocks --output ./mocks

func TestService_CreateIssue(t *testing.T) {
    mockRepo := mocks.NewRepository(t)
    svc := NewService(mockRepo)
    
    mockRepo.On("Create", mock.Anything, mock.AnythingOfType("CreateParams")).
        Return(&Issue{ID: uuid.New(), Title: "Test"}, nil)
    
    issue, err := svc.CreateIssue(context.Background(), CreateIssueRequest{Title: "Test"})
    require.NoError(t, err)
    assert.Equal(t, "Test", issue.Title)
}
```

### Race Detector (always use)

```bash
go test -race -count=1 ./...
go test -race -run TestSpecific ./internal/module/...
```

## Frontend Tests (Vitest + RTL)

```typescript
// components/__tests__/IssueCard.test.tsx
import { render, screen } from '@testing-library/react'
import userEvent from '@testing-library/user-event'
import { IssueCard } from '../IssueCard'

describe('IssueCard', () => {
    it('renders issue title', () => {
        render(<IssueCard issue={mockIssue} />)
        expect(screen.getByText(mockIssue.title)).toBeInTheDocument()
    })

    it('calls onEdit when edit button clicked', async () => {
        const onEdit = vi.fn()
        render(<IssueCard issue={mockIssue} onEdit={onEdit} />)
        await userEvent.click(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /edit/i }))
        expect(onEdit).toHaveBeenCalledWith(mockIssue.id)
    })
})
```

## API Mocking (MSW)

```typescript
// mocks/handlers.ts
import { http, HttpResponse } from 'msw'

export const handlers = [
    http.get('/api/projects/:id/issues', ({ params }) => {
        return HttpResponse.json({ data: mockIssues, total: mockIssues.length })
    }),
]
```

## E2E Tests (Playwright)

```typescript
// e2e/tracker.spec.ts
test.describe('Issue Tracker', () => {
    test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {
        await page.goto('/')
        await loginAs(page, 'member@hub.local')
    })

    test('creates a new issue', async ({ page }) => {
        await page.click('[data-testid="new-issue-btn"]')
        await page.fill('[data-testid="issue-title"]', 'Test Issue')
        await page.click('[data-testid="submit-issue"]')
        await expect(page.locator('[data-testid="issue-card"]').first()).toContainText('Test Issue')
    })
})
```

## Coverage Targets

| Package | Target | Priority |
|---------|--------|----------|
| `auth/` | 80% | Critical (security) |
| `ws/` | 80% | Critical (panic risk) |
| `rbac/` | 80% | Critical (authz) |
| `tracker/` | 60% | High |
| `messenger/` | 60% | High |
| `tms/` | 50% | Medium |
| Overall | 50% | Goal |

## Coverage Artifacts — Cleanup (mandatory)

После прогона покрытия, race-тестов или qa-gate **удали локальные артефакты** до коммита/handoff.

**Go — писать профили только во временную директорию или `/tmp`:**

```bash
# ✅ Preferred: profile outside repo
go test -coverprofile="$TMP/coverage.out" ./internal/...

# ❌ Never leave in backend/
go test -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...
go test -coverprofile=calls_cov.out ./internal/calls/...
go tool cover -func=coverage.out > cover_auth   # text dump in repo root
```

**Удалить после верификации (если создались в repo):**

| Pattern | Пример |
|---------|--------|
| `*.out` | `coverage.out`, `calls_cov.out`, `cover_rbac.out` |
| `backend/cover*` | `cover`, `cover_auth`, `coverprofile`, `covertms` |
| `backend/cov_*` | `cov_auth`, `cov_calls` |
| `backend/*_cov*` | `auth_cov.txt`, `gitlab_cov`, `notif_cov` |
| `backend/tmp*` | `tmpauth`, `tmp-wscov`, `tmp-rbac` |
| `tmp_*.py` | одноразовые скрипты в корне |

**Cleanup one-liner (PowerShell, из корня repo):**

```powershell
Get-ChildItem backend -File | Where-Object {
  $_.Name -match '^(cover|coverage|cov_|tmp|.*_cov)' -or $_.Extension -eq '.out'
} | Remove-Item -Force
Remove-Item -Force tmp_*.py -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
```

**Agent rule:** если ты запускал `go test -coverprofile`, `go tool cover`, race/prof — **удали артефакты в том же PR/сессии** после фиксации метрик в `.planning/COVERAGE.md`. Не коммить dumps; они в `.gitignore`.
